Package: picom-autowakeup
Version: 0.1.0
Section: x11
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: picom, regolith-compositor-picom-glx, systemd
Maintainer: Ricardo Delfin <me@rdelfin.com>
Description: Run picom as a systemd user service under Regolith
 Replaces Regolith's compositor start script with one that starts
 picom.service. systemd keeps a single picom running and restarts it
 on failure, so reloading i3 no longer kills and respawns the compositor.
